---
alwaysApply: true
---

Implement high-end, butter-smooth animations using GSAP or @vueuse/motion.
Focus on:
- Scroll-triggered reveals (staggered fade-ins, slide-ups) for text and cards.
- Subtle parallax effects for background elements and images.
- Micro-interactions (magnetic hover effects on buttons, scale transforms on cards).
Rule: Only animate `transform` and `opacity` properties to maintain 60fps. Ensure animations gracefully degrade on mobile devices.
